### 교대 마감 Preview
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shift-close/preview

### 특이사항 일괄 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/issues/bulk-confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "issueId": 11,
      "expectedStatus": "UNCONFIRMED"
    },
    {
      "issueId": 12,
      "expectedStatus": "UNCONFIRMED"
    }
  ]
}

### 특이사항 일괄 해결
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/issues/bulk-resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "issueId": 21,
      "expectedStatus": "CONFIRMED"
    }
  ]
}

### 특이사항 일괄 담당지정
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/issues/bulk-responsible
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "issueId": 11,
      "expectedResponsibleMateId": null
    },
    {
      "issueId": 12,
      "expectedResponsibleMateId": 3
    }
  ],
  "toMateId": 4,
  "reason": "교대 인수인계"
}

### 일괄처리 Summary 감사로그
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/activity-logs?type=ISSUE_BULK_ACTION&page=0&size=50
